      "registryDependencies": ["alert", "badge", "button", "card", "table"],
      "docs": "Requires the Notification server plugin and authorized access to GET /api/notifications/logs. Mount NotificationLogsPage in an application-owned route and merge locales/ into application locales. Shows the newest 100 logs; adds no route or permissions.",
